\"byline\">李洪兴</div>\n\n      <div class=\"subcols\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"pullquote\">\n            只有主根扎稳了，主体够扎实了，主业干强了，才能不畏风浪、破浪前行\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pullquote\">\n            立足自身特点和优势，专注细分领域，有所为有所不为，就能实现老树抽新枝，留着造造的路子向新迎\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-block\">\n            [illegible]\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-block\">\n          [illegible]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        [illegible]\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\"><span class=\"marker\">■</span>中国道路中国梦·与时代一起奔跑</div>\n      <h1 class=\"headline\">新寨村何以飘来咖啡香</h1>\n      <div class=\"byline\">王加睿</div>\n      <div class=\"subcols\">\n        <div class=\"text-block\">\n          [illegible]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-block\">\n          [illegible]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"byline\">（作者为云南保山市隆阳区瓦马彝族傣族乡党委书记，本报记者徐驭尧整理）</div>\n\n      <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n      <div class=\"pullquote\">\n        区分不同主题，将\"自己讲\"和\"他人讲\"结合起来，善建议式沟通去创，让实践话语走进去，以群众实际情况入手，作出更加得心去接，宣讲才能真正抓住人心\n      </div>\n\n      <h1 class=\"headline big\">基层宣讲要善叙事、能共情</h1>\n      <div class=\"byline center\">刘臻</div>\n\n      <div class=\"subcols three\">\n        <div class=\"text-block\">[illegible]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-block\">[illegible]</div>\n        <div class=\"text-block\">[illegible]</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%; height:230px;\">\n        [Photo: 京剧脸谱装扮演员表演场景，儿童围观教室内景]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">\n        44个国后同兰会国部形写国团结的方队之一在国庆(...)成组队伍中，国家非物质文化遗产传承人的儿童在国团结的方队之一在国庆(...)成组队伍中\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">\n        重庆市南岸区龙门浩小学，孩子们戴着荣昌折扇学习川剧变脸。 秦廷富摄(影像中国)\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col\" style=\"border-right:none;\">\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\"><span class=\"marker\">■</span>人民时评</div>\n\n      <div class=\"rightside-box\">\n        下好投资<br>\"先手棋\"\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        重大项目建设关系增长的权重之计，而是长长化发展的战略之势。无论是项目选取，还是资金投向，还是立足当下，更要着眼长远\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        [illegible]\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"byline\">杨春</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        [illegible]\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\"><span class=\"marker\">■</span>纵横</div>\n      <h1 class=\"headline\">\"串门\"式文旅大有可为</h1>\n      <div class=\"byline\">齐杨</div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        [illegible]\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"call-for-submissions\">\n        <div class=\"title\">欢迎赐稿</div>\n        <div>\n          在您读者，本报\"大家谈\"栏目将对中国道路中国梦\"等日日出栏目和地方精神展开，遇到一起探讨\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n          [来稿请附作者姓名和联系方式]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-editors\">\n        本版责任编辑：李 洪 李国民 常 晴\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
